<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><em>In Claude Code only.</em></p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph">This is the one part you set up by hand =E2=80=94=
 and once Claude Code is running, Claude can do almost everything after thi=
s <em>for</em> you. Three quick things:</p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>1.</strong> <strong>Have a Claude subscri=
ption</strong> (Pro, Max, or Teams) =E2=80=94 this powers Claude Code. Sign=
 up at <a class=3D"md-link" href=3D"https://claude.ai/" target=3D"_blank" r=
el=3D"noreferrer">claude.ai</a> if you don't have one yet.</p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>2.</strong> <strong>Install VS Code</stro=
ng> =E2=80=94 the free editor you'll work in:
<a class=3D"md-link" href=3D"https://code.visualstudio.com/" target=3D"_bla=
nk" rel=3D"noreferrer">=E2=AC=87=EF=B8=8F Download VS Code =E2=86=97</a>
Run the installer with the default options.</p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>3.</strong> <strong>Add the Claude Code e=
xtension &amp; sign in:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"md-list">
<li>Open VS Code =E2=86=92 <strong>Extensions</strong> panel (Ctrl+Shift+X =
/ Cmd+Shift+X)</li>
<li>Search <strong>"Claude Code"</strong> =E2=86=92 click <strong>Install</=
strong> on the first result by Anthropic</li>
<li>Click the <strong>Spark icon (=E2=9C=A6)</strong> top-right =E2=86=92 <=
strong>sign in</strong> with your Claude account</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><img src=3D"http://127.0.0.1:8797/sites/ai-employ=
ee-builders/media/assets/get-access/02-claude-code-extension.png" alt=3D"In=
stalling the Claude Code extension in VS Code"></p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>What you'll see:</strong> search <strong>=
"Claude Code"</strong> in the Extensions panel and click <strong>Install</s=
trong> on the first result by Anthropic.</p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph">These two callouts pointed at "Step 2", a step th=
e Claude Code buyer never sees (#step2 is authored but not in wizSteps()). =
In the wizard this step IS step 2 of 3, so the old copy pointed the buyer a=
t itself. Both now name the next thing they actually get: the paste-one-pro=
mpt card.</p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>That's the only manual install.</strong> =
AIEB now connects to its hosted server directly. On the next step you paste=
 one prompt and Claude installs the plugin, opens the secure browser connec=
tion, and verifies access.</p>
<p class=3D"md-paragraph"><strong>Already use Claude Code?</strong> If the =
extension is installed and you're signed in, tick this and go straight to t=
